{"id":"comboio","lemma":"comboio","pos":"noun","rank":807,"glosses":["train (line of connected cars or carriages)","convoy","convoy (group of vehicles)"],"ipa":"/kõˈbɔj.u/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"comboios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-comboio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estou à espera do comboio.","en":"I'm waiting for the train.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"O comboio acabou de partir.","en":"The train just left.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to split"}]},{"text":"Consegui apanhar o último comboio.","en":"I managed to catch the last train.","words":[{"g":"to get, obtain","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"to collect, gather"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"final"},null]},{"text":"Moro perto da estação de comboios.","en":"I live close to the train station.","words":[{"g":"to live, reside","l":"morar"},{"g":"close, closely, next"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"season"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ela pode ter perdido o comboio.","en":"She may have missed the train.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to own"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}